        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "For behold, if ye deny the Holy Ghost when it once has had place in you, and ye know that ye deny it, behold, this is a sin which is unpardonable; yea, and whosoever murdereth against the light and knowledge of God, it is not easy for him to obtain forgiveness; yea, I say unto you, my son, that it is not easy for him to obtain a forgiveness.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 22,
            "text": "Moro. 8:28; D&C 76:35. TG Holy Ghost, Loss of."
          },
          {
            "start": 133,
            "end": 145,
            "text": "TG Holy Ghost, Unpardonable Sin against."
          },
          {
            "start": 249,
            "end": 260,
            "text": "Rom. 9:18; D&C 64:10. TG Forgive."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
