        "chapter": 39,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And now, my son, I would to God that ye had not been guilty of so great a crime. I would not dwell upon your crimes, to harrow up your soul, if it were not for your good.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 53,
            "end": 59,
            "text": "TG Guilt."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Guilt.",
