        "reference": "Alma 39:18",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 39,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "Is it not as easy at this time for the Lord to send his angel to declare these glad tidings unto us as unto our children, or as after the time of his coming?",
        "footNotes": [
